  "openLoop": "How did a desert get California's largest lake?",
  "payoff": "A 1905 flood sent the whole Colorado River into the basin for two years; since 1999 the lake has been shrinking.",
  "targetEmotion": "surprise",
  "engagementQuestion": "Would you visit a lake that a flood made?",
